I checked the actual repo (not just the excerpts) to verify these before writing them up. Two notes on framing first:

- **No React code exists in this repo** (no `.tsx`/`.jsx` files, no `react` dependency in `package.json`). This is a Node/TypeScript multi-agent backend. I can't find re-render issues that don't exist — if you have a separate frontend repo, point me at it.
